package soul.human-os

artifact final-insight {
    title "The Final Insight"
    cites [soul.revelation.quran.13.28]
    body {
        > **You do not "find" yourself. You maintain a system.**

        The self is not a mystery to be solved. It is an architecture to be defended. Every day, the 1% injects adversarial prompts. Every day, the nafs generates noise. Every day, the qalb must decide: **turn up, or turn down.**

        The Voidlight Human OS is not a belief system. It is a **maintenance manual.**

        The core is already installed. The firmware is already pure. The signal is already broadcasting.

        Your only job is to **keep the receiver on.**

        ---

        *"Verily, in the remembrance of Allah do hearts find rest."* — Ar-Ra'd 13:28 *(catatan audit 2026-11-15: kutipan ini petikan makna bagian akhir ayat, bukan terjemahan seluruh ayat — auditor batch 4, teks lengkap terverifikasi di module dalil/quran/13/28.vdl; auditor note: ayat menyatakan tenteramnya hati orang beriman dengan mengingat Allah, bukan jaminan hilangnya seluruh gejala psikologis)*

        ---

        **System:** Voidlight Human OS\
        **Version:** 1.0\
        **Architecture:** Soulful\
        **Maintainer:** Aria\
        **Status:** Canonical
    }
}
